// Pet lines, zh-TW (PLAN §1.11). One voice per species:
// Shiba warm and clingy · Munchkin tries hard, a little hard done by ·
// Fold opens with 「……」, aloof but fond · Owl 咕 · Chick short bursts 「啾」 ·
// Duckling half a beat slow, ends in 「呱」 · Fox a bossy big sister to
// the other pets (calls herself 姊姊, gives orders, hugs whether they want
// it or not) and 傲嬌 to you (「哼」, says no, tails say yes): Roger's
// persona for her from 2026-11-12.
// {you} is 「牠怎麼叫你」 (up to 8 characters), {name} the pet's name (up to 12).
// A line may be at most 14 characters with those filled in at full length.
